    <item>
      <title>1,647 (and counting): Chaise Smith becomes Washington’s all-time leading scorer</title>
      <link>https://www.thewashingtondailynews.com/sports/1647-and-counting-chaise-smith-becomes-washingtons-all-time-leading-scorer-4e752cb2</link>
      <description>Chaise Smith is Washington High School’s all-time leading scorer. The senior guard broke Calvin Daniels’ two-decade-old mark of 1,940 career points with a 32-point outing in Wednesday’s 78-48 win over North Lenoir in the semifinals of the Three Rivers Conference Tournament.</description>
